Name: Node JS
Short Name: node
URL: https://github.com/nodejs/node
Version: 16.13.0
License: NodeJS
License File: NOT_SHIPPED
Security Critical: no

Description:
This directory holds the Node.js binaries that are downloaded via DEPS hooks.
The binaries are used to run the build process for the website.
The versions in this repo should track (i.e., reuse) the versions packaged
in the chromium/src repo.

Local Modifications:
None
